  "duration": 163.770375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.82,
      "text": "Choosing a music app is straightforward."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.64,
      "end": 4.2,
      "text": "Pick an option and start listening."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.02,
      "end": 7.2,
      "text": "Using AI starts the exact same way."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.7,
      "end": 10.9,
      "text": "Pick a foundational app like Chat, GPT, or Gemini."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.42,
      "end": 13.4,
      "text": "But depending on the app and your subscription,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.04,
      "end": 16.18,
      "text": "you may also be able to choose the model,"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.64,
      "end": 17.78,
      "text": "how much reasoning it uses,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.28,
      "end": 19.9,
      "text": "and whether it performs deeper research."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.5,
      "end": 22.62,
      "text": "You won't make all four choices every time."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.12,
      "end": 25.38,
      "text": "The default settings work well for most routine jobs."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.8,
      "end": 28.94,
      "text": "But when the work is difficult or the results are critical,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.94,
      "end": 32.28,
      "text": "knowing these choices allows you to change the right parameter."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.46,
      "end": 35.22,
      "text": "Your first choice is always the app."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.9,
      "end": 37.48,
      "text": "The remaining three choices are conditional"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.48,
      "end": 39.9,
      "text": "and may only appear depending on your setup."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.64,
      "end": 42.64,
      "text": "You do not need to see every choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.16,
      "end": 45.96,
      "text": "You need to understand what each one does when it appears."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.58,
      "end": 49.18,
      "text": "Let's look at the first two configuration choices"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.18,
      "end": 51.16,
      "text": "you encounter when setting up a task."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.84,
      "end": 53.44,
      "text": "Choice one is which app?"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.0,
      "end": 55.62,
      "text": "Think of this as your home base."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.18,
      "end": 57.98,
      "text": "Choose the app that is available to you"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.98,
      "end": 61.16,
      "text": "and naturally fits the tools and workflows you use the most."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.9,
      "end": 64.12,
      "text": "You should, however, divert to a second app"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.12,
      "end": 68.18,
      "text": "when its specific strengths clearly fit the job at hand better than your home base."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.96,
      "end": 72.52,
      "text": "Once you have chosen your app, you arrive at choice two, which model."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.32,
      "end": 76.44,
      "text": "Many platforms offer a subset of options inside the app."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.02,
      "end": 78.7,
      "text": "Some apps offer a family of models,"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.12,
      "end": 81.64,
      "text": "giving you a range of processing power to select from."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.26,
      "end": 84.6,
      "text": "Use the everyday model for your standard tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.16,
      "end": 88.68,
      "text": "Actively select a more capable model for difficult heavy lift work."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.22,
      "end": 91.94,
      "text": "Selecting the right combination prevents you from wasting"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.94,
      "end": 94.36,
      "text": "slow, powerful computing on simple tasks"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.78,
      "end": 98.14,
      "text": "or failing at complex tasks by relying on too weak a model."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.44,
      "end": 102.76,
      "text": "Now we move to the deeper optional processing configurations"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.22,
      "end": 105.78,
      "text": "that dictate how the AI thinks and searches."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.56,
      "end": 107.86,
      "text": "Choice three is reasoning."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.44,
      "end": 111.02,
      "text": "Depending on the platform, apps might call this setting"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.02,
      "end": 112.78,
      "text": "effort, thinking, or reasoning."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.47,
      "end": 116.76,
      "text": "You want to dial up this setting for math, code, planning,"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.1,
      "end": 120.1,
      "text": "and any problem that requires distinct sequential steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.86,
      "end": 124.04,
      "text": "Keep this at the default setting for routine straightforward work."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.4,
      "end": 125.7,
      "text": "And choice four is research."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.38,
      "end": 129.22,
      "text": "Some apps refer to this feature specifically as deep research."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.06,
      "end": 132.58,
      "text": "Mechanically, this function searches external data,"
    },
    {
      "start": 133.08,
      "end": 134.9,
      "text": "compares various sources against each other,"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.2,
      "end": 136.8,
      "text": "and returns a formally cited report."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.48,
      "end": 140.12,
      "text": "Use this tool for broad or highly current questions"
    },
    {
      "start": 140.12,
      "end": 142.28,
      "text": "that strictly require synthesized information"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.28,
      "end": 143.72,
      "text": "from many different sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.28,
      "end": 147.92,
      "text": "To recap, the four choices are the app, the model,"
    },
    {
      "start": 148.38,
      "end": 150.68,
      "text": "how much reasoning to apply, and whether to run research."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.62,
      "end": 154.12,
      "text": "The choices behind the answer, shape it."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.82,
      "end": 156.16,
      "text": "Use the default when it works."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.04,
      "end": 159.28,
      "text": "Change what you can when the work demands more."
    }
  ],
